1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,255
Five small edits that make any video look more expensive.

2
00:00:03,575 --> 00:00:06,525
Number one: cut on the beat, not on the silence.

3
00:00:06,845 --> 00:00:09,748
Number two: keep your subtitles inside the safe area, at least

4
00:00:09,748 --> 00:00:12,650
forty pixels from the bottom edge.

5
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:16,623
Number three: normalize the audio to minus sixteen LUFS, and

6
00:00:16,623 --> 00:00:20,276
never let the dialogue peak above minus one dB.

7
00:00:20,596 --> 00:00:23,899
Number four: export at fifteen megabits per second for a clean

8
00:00:23,899 --> 00:00:27,202
upload, and always check the first three seconds.

9
00:00:27,522 --> 00:00:29,700
Number five: before you publish, watch your own video once with

10
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,879
the sound off.

11
00:00:32,199 --> 00:00:34,787
That is the whole checklist. Save it, and your next edit will

12
00:00:34,787 --> 00:00:37,375
take half the time.
